Original contributions of this repository
-----------------------------------------
Everything under transport_marl/, scripts/ and figures_src/, together with
ppvc_instance_generator.py and the released datasets, checkpoints and result
files, is original to this work: the transport-coupled environment and its
single-instance reference simulator, the admissible bound and its telescoped
team reward, the bound-counterfactual credit baseline, the certified
action-price channel, the independent feasibility validator, the CP-SAT,
dispatching-rule and genetic-algorithm references, and the evaluation and
statistics pipeline.

